+  (∀ i, 0 < m i) ∧ ContDiff ℝ 2 g ∧ ContDiff ℝ 1 U ∧ 0 ≤ T ∧
+  ContinuousOn X (Icc 0 T) ∧ X 0=x0 ∧
+  (∀ t ∈ Icc 0 T, X t ∈ cotangentConstraint m g) ∧
